Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y): this branch's xml_ffi.rs still tracks
namespaces itself (namespace_stack / seen_first_event / new_namespaces())
instead of the xml crate's declared_namespaces(), and has neither the BOM
stripping in append_to_source() nor XMLParserReplaceLoneSurrogates. The
interior-mutability change is therefore applied onto this branch's version:
XmlReadState wraps event_reader/error_details/parser_callbacks/namespace_stack
in RefCell and last_event_position/seen_first_event in Cell, every FFI entry
point takes &XmlReadState, the event_reader borrow is dropped before each C++
callback (the doctype ids are cloned), and the namespace stack keeps this
branch's logic through borrow()/borrow_mut(). On the C++ side AppendToSource()
is the plain UTF-8 append, Append() keeps only the pending_src_ guard (no
XSL/carry-over context), and the ProcessEvents() loop condition omits the
saw_xsl_transform_ term that does not exist here. ProcessEvents() CHECKs, the
in-loop pending_src_ drain, ResumeParsing() and the header changes apply as
upstream. xml_document_parser_sim_test.cc diverged too far to merge and keeps
the branch version (test-only).

